Claims (6)

We claim:

1. A bearing assembly comprising:

a housing;

an outer ring mounted at least partially within the housing and having an outer surface and a sliding surface on the inner diameter of the outer ring;

an inner ring mounted at least partially within the outer ring and having a sliding surface on the outer diameter thereof, the inner and outer rings defining a bearing space between them;

a plurality of rolling elements disposed within the bearing space and supporting the inner ring for rotation about an axis;

an inboard seal structure supported within the bearing space, the inboard seal structure including a first washer anchored to one of the inner or outer rings and a first sealing member mounted to the washer, wherein the first sealing member is in sliding contact with the sliding surface of the other of the inner or outer rings; and

